static_this.vlt:13:11: error: `A.hello` uses `this` or `super`, so it cannot be used as a value
a static method taken as a value has no `this` (JavaScript calls it with `this` undefined)
call it as `A.hello()`, or wrap the call: `() => A.hello()`
static_this.vlt:14:11: error: `B.hello` uses `this` or `super`, so it cannot be used as a value
a static method taken as a value has no `this` (JavaScript calls it with `this` undefined)
call it as `B.hello()`, or wrap the call: `() => B.hello()`
static_this.vlt:7:37: error: `this` in a static method can only be used to call or read its class's static members
`this` is the class the method was called on: use `this.f()` or `this.NAME`
